              "foundational_architecture": {
                "api_design": {
                  "content": "The API will follow RESTful principles, using JSON for data exchange and versioning using URI prefixes (e.g., `/api/v1`). Authentication will be handled via Sanctum for SPA authentication. [https://laravel.com/docs/11.x/sanctum]\n\nKey Endpoints:\n\n*   **Users:**\n    *   `GET /api/v1/users`: Get all users (paginated).\n    *   `GET /api/v1/users/{id}`: Get a specific user.\n    *   `POST /api/v1/users`: Create a new user (registration).\n    *   `PUT /api/v1/users/{id}`: Update user profile.\n    *   `DELETE /api/v1/users/{id}`: Delete a user (admin only).\n*   **Skills:**\n    *   `GET /api/v1/skills`: Get all skills.\n    *   `GET /api/v1/skills/{id}`: Get a specific skill.\n    *   `POST /api/v1/skills`: Create a new skill (admin only).\n    *   `PUT /api/v1/skills/{id}`: Update a skill (admin only).\n    *   `DELETE /api/v1/skills/{id}`: Delete a skill (admin only).\n*   **Exchange Requests:**\n    *   `GET /api/v1/exchange-requests`: Get all exchange requests (paginated).\n    *   `GET /api/v1/exchange-requests/{id}`: Get a specific exchange request.\n    *   `POST /api/v1/exchange-requests`: Create a new exchange request.\n    *   `PUT /api/v1/exchange-requests/{id}`: Update an exchange request (status, proposed time).\n    *   `DELETE /api/v1/exchange-requests/{id}`: Delete an exchange request.\n*   **Messages:**\n    *   `GET /api/v1/messages/{exchange_request_id}`: Get messages for an exchange request (paginated).\n    *   `POST /api/v1/messages`: Create a new message.\n*   **Reviews:**\n    *   `GET /api/v1/reviews/{user_id}`: Get reviews for a user (paginated).\n    *   `POST /api/v1/reviews`: Create a new review.\n*   **Notifications:**\n    *   `GET /api/v1/notifications`: Get user notifications (paginated).\n    *   `POST /api/v1/notifications/{id}/mark-as-read`: Mark a notification as read.",
                  "section_title": "3. API Design & Key Endpoints"
